olicy must be followed by all employees.\", \"There is no need for all employees to follow the new company policy.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"It is essential that all employees follow the new company policy.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 35,\n      \"question\": \"The research showed that, unless drastic measures were taken, the city would be uninhabitable within a decade.\",\n      \"options\": [\"Unless drastic measures are taken, the city will become uninhabitable in ten years' time.\", \"Drastic measures need to be taken immediately to prevent the city from becoming uninhabitable.\", \"The research indicated that drastic measures should be taken to prevent the city from becoming uninhabitable.\", \"The city would not be uninhabitable unless drastic measures were taken.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"The research showed that, unless drastic measures were taken, the city would be uninhabitable within a decade.\"\n  ]\n}",
